							"paragraphStyle" : {
								"__type" : "textStyle"
							},
							"string" : "Hi Oscar,\n\nThe extended dataset is here: [](https://scg.unibe.ch/assets/files/75/glrwb4ijyyqpvk5cqodh2vo17y8zhx/software_visualization.ods)\n\nI suspect I forgot to remove those columns with numbers. It seems that I used them to create some of the tables and charts in the paper. \n\nI also found the slides I used to present the original paper. You can find them here:\nIn PDF: [](https://www.dropbox.com/scl/fi/wrxw0ho6oc9r1cnonmku8/Review-VISSOFT16-PDF.pdf?rlkey=3kizir7qr20y4gphfxhd4in4j&st=dnphnxmq&dl=0)\nIn Keynote format: [](https://www.dropbox.com/scl/fi/r66liwpd2z9t96iuqmi0f/Review-VISSOFT16.key?rlkey=ftj69lc4j44mxiwhz5n6uqetm&st=0g2wh3aa&dl=0)\n\nBest regards,\nLeonel"
						}
					]
